\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. High in the heavens, eternal God, 
\par Thy goodness in full glory shines; 
\par Thy truth shall break through every cloud
\par That veils and darkness Thy designs.
\par   \tab 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Forever firm Thy justice stands,
\par As mountains their foundations keep;
\par Wise are the wonders of thy hands;
\par Thy judgements are a mighty deep.
\par  
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thy providence is kind and large,
\par Both man and beast Thy bounty share;
\par The whole creation is Thy change,
\par But saints are Thy peculiar care.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. My God, how excellent Thy grace,
\par Whence  all our hope and comfort springs!
\par The sons of Adam in distress 
\par Fly to the shadow of Thy wings.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Life, like a fountain rich and free,
\par Springs from the presence of the Lord;
\par And in Thy light our souls shall see
\par The glories promised in Thy word. 
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

